  "in": 121,
  "out": 255,
  "trans": "THROUGH THE GLASS. Push in on the lens until the circle fills the frame. The next scene, the lecture room of 1923, appears inside the glass, bending at the edges as if seen through it, then straightens as we come out the other side into 2.1.",
