  "text": "",
  "fr": 10,
  "in": 325,
  "out": 335,
  "trans": "Push in on the left half of the board from 2.1. Same board, same chalk, same handwriting, so it must read as the same hand that just wrote it. Nothing new appears, we simply move closer.",
